@startuml
actor User
participant main
participant JsonLite
participant Controller
participant Tui
User -> main: run with input + --tui
main -> JsonLite: load & parse
JsonLite --> main: MicrogridModel
main -> Controller: runSimulation(model)
loop each timestep
  Controller -> Controller: forecast & reserve SoC
  Controller -> Controller: dispatch renew/batt/diesel
  Controller -> Tui: renderStep(...)
end
Controller --> main: summary
@enduml
